Assertions:
[STATE] signed in as the user with email {{buyer}} {SPEC}
[DOM] the label 'Punchout mode' is present in the desktop top header {SPEC}
[DER] the current organization id == {{orgId}} {BL}
[REL] PUNCHOUT_CART_ID == DEFAULT_CART_ID {BL}
[DOM] the cart row containing the text '{{sku}}' shows quantity 1 {SPEC}
[COUNT] me.contact.organizations has exactly 1 entry {SPEC}

[NAV] context B URL after the used link is /403 {SPEC}
[DOM] context B shows the 'Access denied' page after the used link {SPEC}
[STATE] context B is not signed in after the used link (the account menu offers 'Sign in') {SPEC}
[NAV] context B URL after the made-up link is /403 {SPEC}
[STATE] context B is not signed in after the made-up link {SPEC}
[STATE] context A is still signed in as the buyer after context B's attempts {SPEC}

[STATE] the signed-in user's email == {{buyer}} {SPEC}
[DOM] the label 'Punchout mode' is present in the desktop top header {SPEC}
[REL] PUNCHOUT_LINE_IDS shares no id with OTHER_LINE_IDS {BL}
[COUNT] me.contact.organizations has exactly 1 entry {SPEC}
[DER] the current organization id == @td(PUNCHOUT_MAPPING_DEFAULT.currentOrganizationId) {BL}

[STATE] signed in as the user with email {{multiBuyer}} {SPEC}
[COUNT] me.contact.organizations has exactly 1 entry {SPEC}
[DER] that entry's id == {{multiOrg}} {BL}
[DOM] the top header and the account popup contain no element labelled 'Organization' that opens a list of organizations {SPEC}

[STATE] after the session lifetime the buyer is signed out {SPEC}
[NETWORK] a POST to /revoke/token was issued by the storefront at the end of the session {SPEC}
[DOM] the label 'Punchout mode' is no longer present {SPEC}
[NAV] a protected page (/cart) after the sign-out does not show the buyer's cart {SPEC}

[DOM] the label 'Punchout mode' is not present after the password sign-in {SPEC}
[REL] LINES_AFTER == LINES_BEFORE {BL}
[STATE] signed in as the user with email {{buyer}} {SPEC}

[NAV] with the setting on, /punchout/<made-up token> ends on /403 (the route exists and refuses the token) {SPEC}
[NAV] with the setting off, /punchout/<made-up token> does not end on /403 {SPEC}
[REL] the page shown for /punchout/<made-up token> with the setting off == the page shown for /agent-test-unknown-path in the same state (the storefront not-found page) {SPEC}
[REL] the page shown with the setting off != the page shown with it on {SPEC}

[COUNT] LABELS_BY_LOCALE has one non-empty text per language in LOCALES {SPEC}
[FORMAT] no label text matches /^[a-z]+(\.[a-zA-Z_]+)+$/ (a raw dotted i18n key) {SPEC}
[REL] for every language other than English the label text != the English label text 'Punchout mode' {SPEC}
